    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a ghost in a world forgotten by time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your soul  is a brutal 2D precision platformer where you control a ghost wandering the corridors of a forgotten world. This place is not just emptiness. It is a darkness where every move you make could be your last. Traps and the eternal struggle with impossible obstacles are your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a restless spirit, having lost your form and purpose. You are neither alive nor dead \u2013 you simply exist in a world that ignores you, doesn't notice you, but is ready to consume you. A world where every corner hides a deadly danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision is everything: every trajectory, every movement requires perfection. You cannot afford a single mistake, or you'll have to start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangers: spikes, mechanisms \u2013 traps at every corner, ready to devour you into this endless hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal difficulty: the game does not forgive mistakes. You control a ghost that exists in a world built on suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as a maze: every level is not just a place. It\u2019s an enclosed space where every corner can be both a shelter and a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f Death as part of the Journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a ghost. You cannot die, but you can be consumed by the darkness and oblivion. Every mistake is a fall into an endless black void. You will die and return again, trying to overcome unbearable obstacles and break this chain of fear and pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a ghost, doomed to wander a dark world full of traps and oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a ghost in a world forgotten by time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your soul  is a brutal 2D precision platformer where you control a ghost wandering the corridors of a forgotten world. This place is not just emptiness. It is a darkness where every move you make could be your last. Traps and the eternal struggle with impossible obstacles are your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a restless spirit, having lost your form and purpose. You are neither alive nor dead \u2013 you simply exist in a world that ignores you, doesn't notice you, but is ready to consume you. A world where every corner hides a deadly danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision is everything: every trajectory, every movement requires perfection. You cannot afford a single mistake, or you'll have to start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangers: spikes, mechanisms \u2013 traps at every corner, ready to devour you into this endless hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal difficulty: the game does not forgive mistakes. You control a ghost that exists in a world built on suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as a maze: every level is not just a place. It\u2019s an enclosed space where every corner can be both a shelter and a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f Death as part of the Journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a ghost. You cannot die, but you can be consumed by the darkness and oblivion. Every mistake is a fall into an endless black void. You will die and return again, trying to overcome unbearable obstacles and break this chain of fear and pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a ghost, doomed to wander a dark world full of traps and oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p>",
    "short_description": "A dark 2D precision platformer. Every move is a risk. Every level is torture. Survive in a dying world where mistakes mean death and mastery is the only way out. Control a ghost lost among traps and silence in a world that no longer waits for anyone.",
